# Sample targets file for Aegis cron scanner
# Each line is a target: <path|url>[,scanners]
#   - <path|url>: local directory path or git repository URL
#   - [,scanners]: optional comma-separated list of scanners to run
#                  (default: semgrep,trivy,trufflehog)
#
# Examples:
#
# Scan local directory with default scanners
# ~/projects/my-app
#
# Scan git repository with specific scanners
# https://github.com/example/repo.git,semgrep,trivy
#
# Multiple targets
# ~/projects/app1
# https://github.com/org/app2.git
# /opt/shared/libs,semgrep
#
# Comment lines start with # and are ignored
# Blank lines are ignored